  "body": "Nestled in the heart of Castor Bay, this thoughtfully designed 1-bedroom home combines modern convenience with coastal charm. Renowned for its tranquil ambiance and prime location, Castor Bay offers the perfect balance between city accessibility and seaside living. With vibrant Milford Village, scenic walkways, and pristine beaches close by, this area delivers an unbeatable lifestyle for all.\r\n\r\nPositioned just an 8-minute walk from stunning Milford Beach, this home is a peaceful haven offering both relaxation and proximity to everything you need.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this home special?\r\n\r\n* Bright and spacious living: The open-plan living area flows seamlessly to a private patio - ideal for entertaining or unwinding.\r\n* Practical and stylish kitchen: Well-appointed with ample storage and integrated into the living space for everyday ease.\r\n* Comfortable bedroom: Features a built-in wardrobe with smart storage solutions to keep your space tidy.\r\n* Resort-style amenities: A communal swimming pool with safety gating offers a touch of luxury.\r\n* Convenient parking: Dedicated parking space right at your door simplifies daily living.\r\n* Exceptional location: Close to boutique shops, parks, top-rated schools, and the stunning coastline, offering a perfect blend of convenience and leisure.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\n* Single-level design in a quiet and safe complex.\r\n* Easy-maintenance living with a private garden and patio.\r\n* Parking conveniently located right at your doorstep.\r\n* Just minutes from Milford Beach, shops, and cafes.\r\n* Ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, or investors.\r\n* Close to public transport and only 20 minutes from Auckland CBD.\r\n* This property is sure to capture attention, so don't delay. \r\n\r\nCall now to arrange your private viewing and secure your slice of Castor Bay paradise.\r\n\r\nLet's make this house your next home.",
